test.yaml:7:15: action "example/fresh@aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" is at a version that is younger than the cooldown of 7 days: v1.2.0 was released 2 days ago, on 2026-10-11. wait for the version to age before you use it: a compromised release is usually found within days [action-release-cooldown]
test.yaml:9:15: action "example/fresh@v1" is at a version that is younger than the cooldown of 7 days: v1.2.0 was released 2 days ago, on 2026-10-11. wait for the version to age before you use it: a compromised release is usually found within days [action-release-cooldown]
test.yaml:13:15: action "example/fresh@cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc" is at a version that is younger than the cooldown of 7 days: v2.0.0 has no release on GitHub, and its commit cccccccccccc was made 28 hours ago, on 2026-10-12 (the date of a commit is not the one of a release: a tag moved to an older commit looks older than it is). wait for the version to age before you use it: a compromised release is usually found within days [action-release-cooldown]
